WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.641
Like to work with music? The player lives in the status bar, and it keeps playing as you move between projects.

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:15.099
Paste any YouTube link. Recent tracks, repeat and volume are always a click away.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:22.579
And step into the Universe. A live globe of builders, where you can chat, share, and jump into the voice lounge together.
